  "_meta": {
    "description": "Fixed, deterministic test cases for the NOCgentic model benchmark harness. Three tasks mirror the three real agent LLM calls. Do not add live-data dependencies here: NL->SQL is scored structurally (no Athena), and summarization feeds a canned triage-data blob.",
